      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I encountered a new behavior with this. I was in Rooms 4 Days\n\nwrld_a9d89ace-8a47-4e60-8ddf-480a6b66217e\n\nAnd I noticed that the problem is there when i load in. But then as I travel between rooms, the cloth randomly alternates between exhibiting the issue, behaving normally, or, a new behavior, being OFFSET so that the hair is suddenly inside my face and at an angle, as if the cloth was trying to do some sort of closed body pose or falling pose or something. this was my view standing normally in one of the rooms.",
