      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "another pair of screenshots to document this: I went to an MMD map.\n\nIn the map camera, the cloth seems fine. in person, well you can see what I am seeing. a duplicate of my cloth items, that stand t posed. \n\nAlso, I notice that it is marked \"more information needed\" but im not sure what more might be needed.",
