      },
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It has been half a year since the first report, but the issue is still occurring and the cause is unknown.\n\nMy post was merged to the open beta thread, but it was originally a bug report about the regular version of VRChat.\n\nThis is not a report about open beta.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "66f08b400af3d781122f906b",
      "aiGenerated": false,
      "author": {
        "_id": "5b68fbeec52d7b606b4182ec",
        "alias": "Steep Dragon",
        "aliasID": "65c2a31fed6eefce4c8947a1",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/033c1ee98f9cefe2144441ea42f6e1e8.png",
        "created": "2018-08-07T01:54:54.285Z",
        "name": "ElfMom",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62f2b3cf8f8367753b2f0",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2024-09-22T21:25:20.655Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "651c8594b562823cf03c5ac4",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So time has passed, but this issue remains.\n\nAt present, I did some testing and right now, it seems that removing constraints from the avatar fixes the issue.\n\nThe model has an extra invisible armature that is constrained to the avatar's limbs. It's purpose is to provide an alternate shadow to the model. As a result this means there are a lot of constraints involved. So it's possible that too many constraints is what is somehow breaking the cloth on avatars.\n\nNot sure if this is adequate \"more information\"\n\ntldr I updated the avatar, problem still happened. I deleted the constrained model attached to the avatar, and uploaded, and the issue is gone.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
