      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Did more testing. Changed all constraints to those new vrc constraints. Issue still happens. And I still have no idea what triggers it, because I was in a brand new map, yet it was working fine, but if I go to another map that might be new or old, and it happens again.",
