      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So I have some more information on this.\n\nI narrowed down the problem to constraints. the model in question has a second, invisible model constrained to it, for the purposes of providing a different shadow. Naturally, this is a lot of constraints. And I noticed that if I remove that secondary armature from the equation, (or the constraints more specifically) the problem goes away. so it's something about constraints that is breaking the cloth. At least for me.\n\nAnd it doesnt matter if it's unity or VRC constraints. the effect is the same.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
